An MCP tool marked read-only isn't read-only if it hands model-written SQL to DuckDB.

@extelligenceai's Bagel MCP &lt;2.5.5: prompt injection in a log or topic could steer the agent into file reads/writes and SSRF (CVE-2026-138027).

Annotations are hints. Sandbox the engine.

🔵 Day 13: The 2024 Attack Was a PyPI Problem

Bittensor’s 2024 supply-chain attack stemmed from a malicious PyPI package (bittensor 6.12.2) targeting wallet code and decrypted keys—not a blockchain consensus flaw.

